 version←Version req
⍝ Return the application version, or its OpenAPI spec
 version←'5.0.0'
 :If req≡'⍠SPEC'
     openapi_spec←(
         tags:,⊂'System' ⋄ summary:'Get API version' ⋄ operationId: 'getVersion' ⋄ security:⍬
         responses:(
             ⍙200:(
                 description:'Version string'
                 content:(⍙application⍙47⍙json:(schema:(type:'string' ⋄ example: version)))
             )
         )
     )
     version←openapi_spec
 :EndIf
